[2026-05-24T11:12:06.327Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_438","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"gh api repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/234/comments --paginate --jq 'sort_by(.updated_at // .created_at) | reverse | .[0:8] | map({id,created_at,updated_at,user:.user.login,body})'\"","aggregated_output":"[{\"body\":\"🤖 **AI Work Session Started**\\n\\nStarting automated work session at 2026-05-24T10:36:53.345Z\\n\\nThe PR has been converted to draft mode while work is in progress.\\n\\n_This comment marks the beginning of an AI work session. Please wait for the session to finish, and provide your feedback._\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-24T10:36:55Z\",\"id\":4528150048,\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-24T10:36:55Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"},{\"body\":\"Make sure we also solve these issues in this pull request:\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/137\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/139\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/141\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/142\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/146\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/147\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/148\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/155\\r\\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/237\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease read these issues with comments, get latest changes from default branch, and make sure we comprehensively support all the features. So for each type of question and its variations in all supported languages, we will use self awareness facts the system knows about, and also settings like for example name if it was set or not and so on.\\r\\n\\r\\nSo we need to make advance self awareness system, which also configurable, by default we state facts as them are. These self awareness features are similar to docs, so should be accurate and always updated with the codebase.\\r\\n\\r\\nAlso I want to see all tests in a way so question + variations are always near the answer, so it will be easy to review. Answering should also have variations by default.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe need to download all logs and data related about issues to this repository, make sure we compile that data to `./docs/case-studies/pull-request-{id}` folder, and use it to do deep case study analysis (also make sure to search online for additional facts and data), in which we will reconstruct timeline/sequence of events, list of each and all requirements from the issue, find root causes of the each problem, and propose possible solutions and solution plans for each requirement (we should also check known existing components/libraries, that solve similar problem or can help in solutions).\\r\\n\\r\\nIf there is not enough data to find actual root cause, add debug output and verbose mode if not present, that will allow us to find root cause on next iteration.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf issue related to any other repository/project, where we can report issues on GitHub, please do so. Each issue must contain reproducible examples, workarounds and suggestions for fix the issue in code.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease plan and execute everything in this single pull request, you have unlimited time and context, as context auto-compacts and you can continue indefinitely, until it is each and every requirement fully addressed, and everything is totally done.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-24T10:36:15Z\",\"id\":4528147091,\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-24T10:36:15Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"},{\"body\":\"## ✅ Ready to merge\\n\\nThis pull request is now ready to be merged:\\n- All CI checks have passed\\n- No merge conflicts\\n- No pending changes\\n\\n---\\n*Monitored by hive-mind with --auto-restart-until-mergeable flag*\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-23T21:58:09Z\",\"id\":4526630367,\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-23T21:58:09Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"},{\"body\":\"## 🤖 Solution Draft Log\\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\\n\\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\\n- Model: GPT-5.5\\n- Provider: OpenAI\\n- Public pricing estimate: $22.178434\\n\\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\\n- 385.5K / 1.1M (37%) input tokens, 46.8K / 128K (37%) output tokens\\n\\nTotal: (385.5K + 16.2M cached) input tokens, 46.8K output tokens, $22.178434 cost\\n\\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\\n- Requested: `gpt-5.5`\\n- **Model: GPT-5.5** (`gpt-5.5`)\\n\\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Repository** (68364KB)\\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/konard/public-logs/main/log-tmp-solution-draft-log-pr-1779573340524.txt/tmp-solution-draft-log-pr-1779573340524.txt)\\n\\n---\\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-23T21:55:49Z\",\"id\":4526625726,\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-23T21:55:49Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"},{\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- hive-mind:working-session-summary --\\u003e\\n## Working session summary\\n\\nImplemented and pushed the fix to PR 234: https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/234\\n\\nWhat changed:\\n- Added `known_facts` handling for prompts like `какие факты ты знаешь?` / `Which facts you know?`\\n- Added architecture follow-up handling for LLM/OpenAI/API questions.\\n- Mirrored behavior in Rust solver, web worker, and browser fallback.\\n- Added unit regression tests and an e2e demo assertion.\\n- Added changelog fragment and removed the temporary `.gitkeep` placeholder.\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `cargo fmt --check`\\n- `git diff --check`\\n- `node --check src/web/formal_ai_worker.js \\u0026\\u0026 node --check src/web/app.js`\\n- `cargo test issue_146 --test unit`\\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\\n- `cargo test`\\n- `rust-script` file-size and changelog checks\\n- Targeted Playwright demo test\\n\\nCI for latest commit `43c8ccb` is passing: https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/26344411013  \\nThe first Windows attempt failed in the GitHub cache step before tests ran; rerunning the failed job passed. Working tree is clean.\\n\\n---\\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-23T21:55:35Z\",\"id\":4526625289,\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-23T21:55:35Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"}]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
