[2026-05-24T11:12:06.566Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_436","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'gh pr view 234 --repo link-assistant/formal-ai --json title,body,isDraft,url,headRefName,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup'","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Recognize general fact-inventory prompts such as `какие факты ты знаешь?` and `Which facts you know?`.\\n- Answer with the available fact sources: local Links Notation seed/rules, web search when available, conversation memory, and self facts.\\n- Handle decoded LLM/OpenAI/API architecture follow-ups with an explicit deterministic-runtime explanation instead of the unknown fallback.\\n- Mirror the behavior in the web worker and local browser fallback.\\n\\nFixes #146\\n\\n## Tests\\n- `cargo fmt --check`\\n- `git diff --check`\\n- `node --check src/web/formal_ai_worker.js && node --check src/web/app.js`\\n- `cargo test issue_146 --test unit`\\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\\n- `cargo test`\\n- `RUST_LOG=warn rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`\\n- `RUST_LOG=warn rust-script scripts/check-changelog-fragment.rs`\\n- `npx playwright test --config=playwright.local.config.js tests/demo.spec.js -g \\\"behavior rules can be listed\\\"`\",\"headRefName\":\"issue-146-3f926558fe76\",\"isDraft\":true,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNSTABLE\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/26359647338/job/77592678217\",\"name\":\"Detect Changes\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-24T11:11:47Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI/CD Pipeline\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/26359647338/job/77592678220\",\"name\":\"Ve