[2026-05-24T11:12:47.176Z] [INFO] {"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- Expand the self-awareness prompt cluster requested on PR 234 across issues #137, #139, #141, #142, #146, #147, #148, #155, and #237.\n- Route Russian self-introduction, known-facts/world-knowledge, LLM/OpenAI/world-model/working-principle, project-purpose, and conversation-topic prompts before unknown or article fallbacks.\n- Mirror the Rust solver behavior in the web worker and local browser fallback, including assistant-name configuration status in self-facts.\n- Add the PR 234 case study and raw issue/PR evidence under `docs/case-studies/pull-request-234/`.\n\nFixes #146\nAddresses #137, #139, #141, #142, #147, #148, #155, #237\n\n## Tests\n- `cargo fmt --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node --check src/web/formal_ai_worker.js`\n- `node --check src/web/app.js`\n- `cargo test issue_146 --test unit`\n- `cargo test --test unit`\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\n- `cargo test --all-features --verbose`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs` (warning-band files only, no violations)\n- `rust-script scripts/check-changelog-fragment.rs`\n- `cargo run --quiet -- chat --prompt 'Поговорим о бытие'`\n\n## Notes\n- Local Playwright e2e was not rerun in this workspace because `node_modules` is absent; the web worker and browser fallback files were syntax-checked and mirrored from the Rust regression coverage.\n- Case study: `docs/case-studies/pull-request-234/README.md`\n","headRefName":"issue-146-3f926558fe76","isDraft":false,"mergeStateStatus":"UNSTABLE","reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/26359647338/job/77592678217","name":"Detect Changes","startedAt":"2026-05-24T11:11:47Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"CI/CD Pipeline"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-05-24T11:12:42Z",
