[2026-05-24T11:24:05.338Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_505","type":"reasoning","text":"**Addressing comments and updates**\n\nI see we have comments to consider. It might be useful to issue new comments that include a list of issues beyond the initial four lines, which are truncated. I should capture a summary of these issues but also ensure the final update addresses them comprehensively. Since the local Playwright didn’t rerun due to missing node_modules, I wonder if I should update the PR body notes to mention that the CI e2e test passed. It's a bit convoluted, but I’ll clarify in the notes!\n**Updating PR body and comments**\n\nI think I need to improve the PR body to include the successful CI/CD pipeline run and its relation to the local demo e2e. There's a note about local Playwright not rerunning due to missing node_modules—I wonder if I should edit the PR body to clarify this. Adding a mention of the CI run seems helpful, but I’m unsure if it requires a new commit. I could also add a comment to address the 10:36 comment, but I might end up adding unnecessary noise.\n**Verifying PR status**\n\nI see the user instructions say to comment when human help is needed, but I don’t think that’s necessary right now. I might check the PR view status for the statusCheckRollup after the successful run to confirm everything looks good. I already have the successful run list, but it could help to fetch the mergeStateStatus to ensure it's clean. Alright, I think I’ll need to complete my update plan as well!"}}
